WEBVTT

NOTE
Pebble 2.0 launch film: captions of its on-screen type (the film has no voice).
Copied by tools/captions/build.mjs from video/out/launch/pebble-2.0-launch.vtt, which video/src/launch/master/captions.ts writes; edit the cue list there, not this file.

c01
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
This is Pebble.

c02
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.400
It’s small.

c03
00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:03.867
It just went up against
Claude Code and Codex.

c04
00:00:03.867 --> 00:00:08.067
Same model. Same tasks.

c05
00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:09.667
Pebble 2.0

c06
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:13.133
The desktop companion that does real work,
and shows its evidence.

c07
00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:16.467
It lives on your Mac.

c08
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.067
On every Space.

c09
00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:19.967
Click. Ask.

c10
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.567
Now it can use your Mac.

c11
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.067
Your apps.

c12
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.067
Your calendar.

c13
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.733
Your browser.

c14
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.867
The app windows and websites you allow.

c15
00:00:31.867 --> 00:00:34.667
Done means checked.

c16
00:00:35.933 --> 00:00:37.433
AgentGuard. Evidence before “done”.
Tests the host ran, not the model’s word.

c17
00:00:37.433 --> 00:00:39.767
Files you asked to keep, kept.
Output matched to its file, byte for byte.

c18
00:00:40.733 --> 00:00:44.200
It builds small tools for itself.

c19
00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:47.233
When the check disagrees, it asks you.

c20
00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:50.533
It remembers what matters.

c21
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:52.567
All visible.

c22
00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:54.567
Forget anything.

c23
00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:55.833
Context warping.

c24
00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:58.500
Long tasks keep a smaller window.

c25
00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:01.300
Older results sealed.
Any one returned exactly.

c26
00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:04.067
Pebble, in your pocket.

c27
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.733
Pebble Remote for iPhone.

c28
00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:08.433
Approve with Face ID.

c29
00:01:08.433 --> 00:01:09.867
Open source. Build it with Xcode.

c30
00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:11.400
Presenting?

c31
00:01:11.433 --> 00:01:12.633
Stealth Lockdown.

c32
00:01:12.633 --> 00:01:15.867
Hidden from screen capture and screen
sharing, not from a camera, a capture card

c33
00:01:15.867 --> 00:01:19.067
or a process list. Exams and interviews
that forbid assistants still forbid it.

c34
00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:21.067
So. How did it do?

c35
00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:22.267
Tasks done correctly.

c36
00:01:22.267 --> 00:01:23.467
Pebble 92.2 %. Claude Code 83.5 %.

c37
00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:24.667
Pebble 95.3 %. Codex 90.6 %.

c38
00:01:24.933 --> 00:01:26.133
Said “done” when it wasn’t.
Lower is better.

c39
00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:27.333
Pebble 6.3 %. Claude Code 13.7 %.

c40
00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:28.533
Pebble 3.9 %. Codex 7.1 %.

c41
00:01:28.533 --> 00:01:29.733
Cost per task.
Lower is better.

c42
00:01:29.733 --> 00:01:30.933
Pebble $0.091. Claude Code $0.117.

c43
00:01:30.933 --> 00:01:32.167
Pebble $0.042. Codex $0.050.

c44
00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:35.967
Small pebble.
Real work.

c45
00:01:36.433 --> 00:01:37.900
Pebble 2.0
Free and open source,

c46
00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:39.400
for Macs with Apple silicon.
github.com/tohin003/Pebble
